          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Flurry of Cards",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Zellara unleashes a barrage of harrow cards that deals 7d6 void damage in a 30-foot cone (DC 34 basic Reflex save save)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Harrow Binding",
      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements Zellara is within 120 feet of a harrow card or harrow deck\n\n---\n\nEffect Zellara intentionally binds herself to a harrow card or deck she can sense. While bound in this way, she grants her Stack the Deck ability to anyone carrying the bound card or deck. The trigger and effect for Stack the Deck changes to affect the creature carrying the bound item. She can still Stack the Deck for herself while bound. Zellara can unbind herself from the item as an action, which has the concentrate trait."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Stack the Deck",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "fortune",
        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "Trigger Zellara is about to attempt a saving throw\n\n---\n\nEffect Zellara looks to her immediate future and determines the most favorable outcome for her. She gains a +4 circumstance bonus to the triggering saving throw. If she rolls a critical failure on her saving throw, she can reroll the check, but does so without the bonus.",
      "rules": [
